X:1
T:Euabalong Ball
T:Wooyeo Ball
% NFF Book 2022
C:Trad
S:collected by A. L. Lloyd
N:This tune may be part of a family of tunes that include "Henry Martin" 
N:and "Villikins and his Dinah"
H:Euabalong is a small town on the Lachlan river some 80k west of Parkes NSW.
H:The lyrics of this tune date from 1880s outback NSW.
H:The song and tune was published in "Manifold Penguin Australian Song Book" c.1935.
H:The song and tune was collected by A.L.Lloyd c.1930 who subsequently recorded and
H:published a folked version in 1953.
H:Additional background is available from the "Australian Folksongs" website:
H:- http://folkstream.com/119.html
H:- http://folkstream.com/035.html
R:Waltz
